it sat on Pam's desk or it was in her drawer.
它也一直放在帕姆的桌子上或者抽屉里。

486
00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.020
Yeah.
嗯。

487
00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.120
So I have that.
所以我留着那个。

488
00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:50.340
I have Pam's everyday purse that she had for most of the season.
我有帕姆在大部分剧集中用的那个日常包。

489
00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:50.900
Oh.
哦。

490
00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.380
But I didn't keep a fancy purse.
但我没留那个时髦的包。

491
00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:58.480
There's this scene where Michael has to refer to Katie the purse girl as Pam 6.0.
有一场戏，迈克尔必须把卖包的女孩凯蒂称为“帕姆6.0”。

