00:17:58.580 --> 00:17:58.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

493
00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.420
This was not an improvisation.
这不是即兴发挥。

494
00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.680
I have the script.
我有剧本。

495
00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:04.200
I know.
我知道。

496
00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:04.440
I know.
我知道。

497
00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.100
From Hot Girl.
来自《辣妹》那一集。

498
00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.160
I have all the scripts from season one.
我有第一季所有的剧本。

499
00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.180
I saved them, speaking of saving things.
我把它们保存了下来，说到保存东西。

500
00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.540
And I looked it up.
我查过了。

501
00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.940
She is like the improved version of me.
她就像是我的升级版。

502
00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:13.900
Like she is.
她确实是。

503
00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.100
Yes, she is.
没错，她是。

504
00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:15.840
She is not.
她不是。

505
00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:16.600
She is.
她是。

506
00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.680
As your best friend, I am not going to let that slide.
作为你最好的朋友，我可不能就这么算了。

507
00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:19.460
She is not.
她不是。

508
00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.680
But in this episode, they had really zhuzhed her up.
但在这一集里，他们确实把她好好打扮了一番。

509
00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.920
She had a push-up bra on and her hair all.
她穿了聚拢文胸，头发也做了造型。

510
00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:25.120
It doesn't matter.
那不重要。

511
00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:29.820
Even on our plainest day, Amy Adams is Jenna 6.0.
就算在我们最朴素的时候，艾米·亚当斯也是6.0版本的珍娜。

512
00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:30.360
She is.
她是。

513
00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:30.920
No, she's not.
不，她不是。

514
00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:31.840
It's okay with me.
我没意见。

515
00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:32.540
No, I'm not.
不，我不是。

516
00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:32.940
I'm not.
我不是。

517
00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:33.280
No.
不。

518
00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.320
Well, oh, okay.
好吧，噢，行吧。

519
00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:35.340
Well, whatever.
好吧，随你便。

520
00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:36.760
Should I have not said that?
我是不是不该说那个？

521
00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:37.960
No, I think you.
不，我觉得你……

522
00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.420
No, I think it's a funny story.
不，我觉得这故事挺有趣的。

523
00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:43.520
But as your best friend, I'm not going to let you say Amy Adams is a better version of you.
但作为你最好的朋友，我不能让你说艾米·亚当斯是你的升级版。

524
00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:46.680
It's like we look similar, but then her nose is a little daintier.
就像我们长得有点像，但她的鼻子更精致一点。

