那天晚上结束时，他们把我们重置回停车场，我们就坐在那儿，坐在卡车里。

1292
00:46:47.160 --> 00:46:48.440
We sat there in the truck.
我们就坐在那辆卡车里。

1293
00:46:48.560 --> 00:46:53.840
And then all of a sudden, we saw everyone driving away in their own cars.
突然间，我们看到大家都开着自己的车走了。

1294
00:46:54.120 --> 00:46:54.760
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1295
00:46:55.160 --> 00:46:57.020
They left us in the truck.
他们把我们忘在卡车里了。

1296
00:46:57.020 --> 00:47:01.300
They forgot to tell us that they had wrapped for the day.
他们忘了告诉我们今天已经杀青了。

1297
00:47:01.580 --> 00:47:03.340
And we were all done and we were leaving.
我们都拍完了，正准备离开。

1298
00:47:03.520 --> 00:47:04.220
You were done.
你们拍完了。

1299
00:47:04.320 --> 00:47:05.940
You were changing clothes.
你们在换衣服。

1300
00:47:06.160 --> 00:47:07.780
You were getting in your cars.
你们正上车离开。

1301
00:47:07.780 --> 00:47:09.460
We saw the director leave.
我们看到导演离开了。

1302
00:47:09.700 --> 00:47:10.660
We saw actors.
我们看到了演员们。

1303
00:47:11.000 --> 00:47:13.160
David and I were like, what?
大卫和我当时心想，什么情况？

1304
00:47:13.520 --> 00:47:13.940
What?
什么？

1305
00:47:13.940 --> 00:47:14.980
What is going on?
到底发生了什么？

1306
00:47:16.280 --> 00:47:17.620
And here's the thing.
重点是这个。

1307
00:47:17.760 --> 00:47:19.200
I've talked about this before.
我之前谈过这件事。

1308
00:47:19.440 --> 00:47:22.240
David Denman and I were very good friends in real life.
大卫·丹曼和我在现实生活中是非常好的朋友。

1309
00:47:22.240 --> 00:47:29.980
We talked about in the basketball episode how you and I became best friends because we had to sit on that bench for hours and hours.
我们在聊篮球那一集时提到过，你和我之所以成为最好的朋友，是因为我们不得不坐在那条长凳上好几个小时。

1310
00:47:30.680 --> 00:47:34.100
This is really the episode where David and I became such good friends.
这一集确实是大卫和我成为好朋友的契机。

1311
00:47:34.240 --> 00:47:36.280
Well, you had a lot of St. Louis connections.
嗯，你们有很多关于圣路易斯的共同点。

1312
00:47:36.340 --> 00:47:36.760
We did.
确实如此。

1313
00:47:36.780 --> 00:47:37.380
You had mutual friends.
你们有共同的朋友。

1314
00:47:37.380 --> 00:47:39.360
And we had the poker connection.
而且我们还有打扑克的交情。

1315
00:47:39.580 --> 00:47:40.040
Yes.
没错。

1316
00:47:40.280 --> 00:47:43.680
David and I played in a poker game together with our crew.
大卫和我曾和我们的剧组人员一起打过扑克。

1317
00:47:43.960 --> 00:47:45.580
We would host these poker games.
我们会组织这些扑克局。

1318
00:47:45.700 --> 00:47:46.720
Rain was in on it.
雷恩也参与其中。

1319
00:47:47.220 --> 00:47:49.840
Chris Workman, who was one of our camera operators.
还有我们的摄影师之一，克里斯·沃克曼。

1320
00:47:50.540 --> 00:47:52.280
Ed, our camera assistant.
我们的摄影助理埃德。

1321
00:47:52.800 --> 00:47:55.020
We would all get together and we would play poker.
我们大家会聚在一起打扑克。

1322
00:47:55.540 --> 00:47:56.860
And he was part of that.
他也是其中的一员。

1323
00:47:56.980 --> 00:47:58.240
So he was one of my poker pals.
所以他是我打扑克的好友之一。

1324
00:47:58.960 --> 00:48:04.900
And anyway, this was the episode where we really became friends because we got left in that truck.
总之，这一集是我们真正成为朋友的契机，因为我们被留在了那辆卡车里。

1325
00:48:05.140 --> 00:48:06.160
You got stuck in that truck.
你们被困在那辆卡车里了。

1326
00:48:06.460 --> 00:48:07.100
Jenna, do you know what?
珍娜，你知道吗？

1327
00:48:07.140 --> 00:48:12.200
I'm seeing a theme here that you become really close friends with people that you are in a confined space with.
我发现了一个规律，你总是会和那些与你共处狭小空间的人成为好朋友。

1328
00:48:12.240 --> 00:48:13.520
That I get stuck with.
那些我被困住的人。

1329
00:48:13.960 --> 00:48:14.580
You're stuck on a bench.
你被困在长凳上。

1330
00:48:14.700 --> 00:48:15.740
I'll be Angela's best friend.
我会成为安吉拉最好的朋友。

1331
00:48:15.740 --> 00:48:16.740
I'm stuck in a truck.
我被困在卡车里。

1332
00:48:16.920 --> 00:48:17.780
David, let's play poker.
大卫，我们来打扑克吧。

1333
00:48:18.700 --> 00:48:20.760
Get stuck in an elevator with me.
跟我一起困在电梯里吧。

1334
00:48:20.880 --> 00:48:22.480
And then you're going to be best friends.
然后你就会成为我最好的朋友。

1335
00:48:22.540 --> 00:48:23.420
Friends for life.
一辈子的好朋友。

1336
00:48:23.600 --> 00:48:25.420
I have my final note card.
我有最后一张笔记卡。

1337
00:48:25.600 --> 00:48:26.020
Ready?
准备好了吗？

1338
00:48:26.320 --> 00:48:26.720
Yes.
好了。

1339
00:48:27.080 --> 00:48:27.540
All right.
好的。

1340
00:48:27.960 --> 00:48:39.940
At around 21 minutes, 25 seconds, you see both Meredith, played by Kate Flannery, and Meredith, played by Henriette, in the same episode.
在大约21分25秒的时候，你会看到凯特·弗兰纳里饰演的梅雷迪思和亨丽埃特饰演的梅雷迪思出现在同一集中。

1341
00:48:39.940 --> 00:48:41.840
Yes, you saw it, Angela.
没错，你看到了，安吉拉。

1342
00:48:41.840 --> 00:48:50.520
I saw it, and I almost texted you, background expert, but I thought, no, I'm going to wait and see if she sees it.
我看到了，我差点就发短信给你这位背景专家了，但我心想，不，我要等等看她能不能发现。

1343
00:48:50.660 --> 00:48:52.220
Yes, this is a huge mistake.
是的，这是一个巨大的失误。

1344
00:48:52.520 --> 00:48:53.300
It's a huge mistake.
这真是个大失误。

1345
00:48:53.440 --> 00:48:59.060
So basically, while Michael has this talking head, they want to show all these clips of different women in the office.
基本上，当迈克尔在进行单人访谈时，他们想展示办公室里不同女性的片段。

1346
00:48:59.060 --> 00:49:07.100
And they used, like, some footage from the pilot before Kate Flannery came on, and it was Henriette as Meredith.
他们用了一些试播集里的素材，那是凯特·弗兰纳里加入之前的，当时是亨丽埃特饰演梅雷迪思。

1347
00:49:07.280 --> 00:49:12.820
You have this montage that goes Kate Flannery to Henriette to Luanne, who played in the Annex.
你看到了一个蒙太奇镜头，从凯特·弗兰纳里切换到亨丽埃特，再到在附楼工作的卢安。

1348
00:49:12.820 --> 00:49:16.020
Who was one of our extras for a very long time, so that makes sense.
她做了我们很长时间的临时演员，所以这说得通。

1349
00:49:16.460 --> 00:49:19.300
I saw that, and I got so excited for you.
我看到了那一幕，我为你感到非常兴奋。

1350
00:49:19.400 --> 00:49:20.400
I got so excited.
我太激动了。

1351
00:49:20.640 --> 00:49:21.480
Because you knew.
因为你早就知道了。

1352
00:49:21.620 --> 00:49:22.940
I knew you were going to clock it.
我就知道你会发现的。

1353
00:49:23.080 --> 00:49:24.600
You knew I had my note card ready.
你知道我准备好了小卡片。

1354
00:49:24.860 --> 00:49:27.680
I have a final little tidbit.
我还有一个最后的小花絮。

1355
00:49:27.960 --> 00:49:29.680
I have a Fisher tidbit.
关于费舍尔的小花絮。

1356
00:49:29.860 --> 00:49:30.760
The coffee maker.
那个咖啡机。

1357
00:49:30.940 --> 00:49:33.360
We never find out who won the coffee maker.
我们从来没交代过到底是谁赢了那个咖啡机。

1358
00:49:33.640 --> 00:49:34.080
No.
没交代。

1359
00:49:34.660 --> 00:49:36.900
I'm feeling like I need to know.
我感觉我非得知道不可。

1360
00:49:37.100 --> 00:49:39.920
We never find out who won it, and we never see it again.
我们从没交代过谁赢了，之后也再没见过它。

1361
00:49:40.060 --> 00:49:40.400
We never see it again.
再也没见过它。

1362
00:49:40.400 --> 00:49:41.520
So it doesn't stay in the office.
所以它没留在办公室里。

1363
00:49:42.100 --> 00:49:44.920
I asked Phil Shea, because a fan wrote in.
我问了菲尔·谢，因为有粉丝写信来问。

1364
00:49:45.020 --> 00:49:47.200
They wanted to know, did any of us get to keep it?
他们想知道，我们中有没有人把它留下了？

1365
00:49:47.260 --> 00:49:50.280
People are very interested in the things we're allowed to keep and not keep.
大家对我们能留下什么、不能留下什么非常感兴趣。

1366
00:49:50.420 --> 00:49:50.880
I get it.
我懂的。

1367
00:49:51.500 --> 00:49:52.680
He said no.
他说没有。

1368
00:49:53.100 --> 00:49:57.720
He said it was borrowed from Starbucks and had to be returned.
他说那是从星巴克借来的，必须归还。

1369
00:49:58.180 --> 00:49:59.100
I believe that.
我相信这一点。

1370
00:49:59.100 --> 00:50:00.580
Where is that machine now?
那台机器现在在哪儿呢？

1371
00:50:00.620 --> 00:50:05.520
I actually believe that, and I bet the purses were returned, because we were on a tight budget,
我确实相信这一点，我敢打赌那些包包也都还回去了，因为我们当时预算很紧，

1372
00:50:05.520 --> 00:50:10.100
and we thought we were getting canceled, and we didn't want to give NBC any reason to think
而且我们以为剧集要被砍了，我们不想给NBC任何理由认为

1373
00:50:10.100 --> 00:50:10.900
we were trouble.
我们是个麻烦。

1374
00:50:11.380 --> 00:50:11.800
That's right.
没错。

1375
00:50:12.000 --> 00:50:15.960
So I believe that all of that was returned, and we got to recoup that money.
所以我相信那些东西都还回去了，我们也得以收回那笔钱。

1376
00:50:16.120 --> 00:50:16.860
For sure.
肯定的。

1377
00:50:17.260 --> 00:50:20.080
Well, Jenna, I think that was some really fun fast facts.
好了，珍娜，我觉得这些快问快答真的很有趣。

1378
00:50:20.180 --> 00:50:21.280
You did a great job.
你做得太棒了。

1379
00:50:21.640 --> 00:50:21.960
Wow.
哇。

1380
00:50:22.140 --> 00:50:22.620
Thank you.
谢谢。

1381
00:50:23.200 --> 00:50:23.880
You're welcome.
不客气。

1382
00:50:23.880 --> 00:50:25.840
I really appreciate it, Angela.
安吉拉，我真的很感激。

1383
00:50:26.140 --> 00:50:26.680
Oh, no, no, no.
噢，不，不，不。

1384
00:50:26.680 --> 00:50:27.220
I think.
我觉得。

1385
00:50:27.520 --> 00:50:33.000
Now I need to hear you sing, because if that's what you sound like, I just realized we've never
现在我得听你唱一首，因为如果这就是你的嗓音，我才意识到我们还从来没

1386
00:50:33.000 --> 00:50:35.220
done karaoke or anything together.
一起去过卡拉OK什么的。

1387
00:50:35.220 --> 00:50:42.420
On the wings of love, only the two of us together fly and hide.
在爱的羽翼上，只有我们俩一起飞翔躲藏。

1388
00:50:42.560 --> 00:50:43.340
Okay, don't sing anymore.
好了，别再唱了。

1389
00:50:43.340 --> 00:50:44.300
We'll have to pay for it.
我们得付版权费的。

1390
00:50:45.680 --> 00:50:49.080
But now I know you're, now I have got your karaoke voice.
不过现在我知道了，现在我听过你的卡拉OK嗓音了。

1391
00:50:49.240 --> 00:50:50.460
And it's whispery.
而且是气声唱法。

1392
00:50:50.760 --> 00:50:53.080
Well, I'm trying to cover up my floss.
嗯，我在试图掩盖我的牙线。

1393
00:50:53.440 --> 00:50:56.060
And if you can't really sing, you whisper sing.
如果你真的不会唱歌，你就会用气声唱。

1394
00:50:56.500 --> 00:50:57.840
And that was Hot Girl.
以上就是《辣妹》那一集的内容。

1395
00:50:58.020 --> 00:50:59.400
And that wraps up season one.
这也为第一季画上了句号。

1396
00:50:59.600 --> 00:51:02.020
Season one, where you and I become best friends.
第一季，你和我成为了最好的朋友。

1397
00:51:02.020 --> 00:51:02.280
Yes.
是的。

1398
00:51:02.480 --> 00:51:03.980
Because you were stuck on a bench with me.
因为你被困在长椅上和我待在一起。

1399
00:51:04.180 --> 00:51:04.340
Yeah.
没错。

1400
00:51:04.520 --> 00:51:07.100
And where you also became friends with someone because you were stuck in a car with them.
还有你和某人也成为了朋友，因为你被困在车里和他们待在一起。

1401
00:51:07.260 --> 00:51:07.420
Yeah.
没错。

1402
00:51:07.600 --> 00:51:08.440
See a pattern here.
看出规律了吗。

1403
00:51:08.900 --> 00:51:10.380
What's going to happen season two?
第二季会发生什么呢？

1404
00:51:10.660 --> 00:51:13.040
Who do I get stuck with in season two?
第二季我会和谁搭档？

1405
00:51:13.560 --> 00:51:14.180
Dun, dun, dun.
当当当。

1406
00:51:14.720 --> 00:51:17.800
Speaking of season two, we are going to start with the Dundies.
说到第二季，我们将从“邓迪奖”那集开始。

1407
00:51:18.020 --> 00:51:18.700
Oh, I can't wait.
哦，我等不及了。

1408
00:51:18.820 --> 00:51:19.740
That's a big episode.
那可是重要的一集。

1409
00:51:19.900 --> 00:51:21.420
A very, very big episode.
非常、非常重要的一集。

1410
00:51:21.780 --> 00:51:22.080
All right.
好的。

